'''Oasis Ground''' is a beneficial [[ground effect]] that grants a [[buff]] which [[regenerate]]s 10% of [[life]] and [[mana]] while standing on it. The buff does not stack even if multiple areas overlap.

__TOC__

==Sources==
Oasis Ground is exclusively found in [[Mirage]]s if the Wish for Oases is chosen.

